I don't think any of the code handles different chain lengths.

But I'm about to publish my preliminary spec for ragged arrays
this afternoon, and we can probably use whatever we do for that.

- Bob

> On Apr 3, 2015, at 1:41 AM, Allen B. Riddell <a...@ariddell.org> wrote:
