OK, I figured it out.  The problem is that I was including
this:

#include <stan/math/rev.hpp>

which I hoped would bring in all of the autodiff functions,
but it doesn't.  Then trying to bring in the model header afterward
didn't work, so there's an order dependency there.

So if I get rid of the above include and just use

#include <stan/model/model_header.hpp>

then it works.

- Bob

